   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>Hi Kushaal,</div><div><br></div><div>You can try your luck with <span style=\"font-family:Courier New\">timeformat=&quot;auto&quot;</span> or provide <span style=\"font-family:Courier New\">timeformat</span> argument for the non-POSIX format that your timestamps are in: see <span style=\"font-family:Courier New\">help(&#39;as.telemetry&#39;)</span></div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Chris<br></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
