nt-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\">Below is my current script and how my data frame looks like before converting into as.telemetry;</span></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:medium none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.2;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"></span></span></font><br>df &lt;- read.csv(&quot;C:/Users/Kushaal/Downloads/serow_trial2a.csv&quot;<br>               , stringsAsFactors = FALSE)<br><br>df$timestamp &lt;- as.POSIXct(df$timestamp, tz = &quot;UTC&quot;, format = &quot;%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%OS&quot;)</div>"
